    "prompt": "The line $l$ with the equation $x-2y+4=0$ passes through the point $A(8,6)$ and intersects the $x$-axis at $B$ as shown on the diagram below.\n\nThe line through $A$ and perpendicular to $l$ intersects the $x$-axis at $C$.",
